{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100694","id":2247769496,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6F-j2Y","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100694","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100694.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100694.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100694","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100694/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100694/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100694/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/25cd923ea15317451c7d9f271fb364487ef3b101","number":100694,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Destruct `CowData` more graciously by avoiding accidentally exposing a half-destructed buffer.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This can avoid problems with cyclic references (and breakers).\r\nYou may think it's rare, but one such cyclic reference is currently occurring in `GDScript` compiler behavior and leading to half-destructed buffers being copied around. This is not leading to problems _right now_, because of a coincidental inefficiency in `CowData` is leading to a technically unnecessary fork of the data before double destruction can occur. In the worst case, the array would have been `reallocated` halfway through destruction, causing undefined behavior and possibly segmentation faults.\r\n\r\nMy PR removing the unnecessary forks (#100619) triggered the bug more harshly, and this led to very strange leaks occurring.\r\n\r\nImportantly, `master` currently fails this simple sanity check:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/75b7a03db68211ae68a9c01386472363dad69639\r\n\r\nThis PR no longer fails the sanity check. \r\n\r\nI also added a test to make sure there is no regression of this behavior.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","descr